        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 857,
      "author": {
        "id": 3773521
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-28T22:51:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes branch in the flow is not the best. So far combination GET + SET VDO doesn\u0027t work. Logs shows correct values but IDH is not actually set based on PD traffic. For now I will try to stick to just setting IDH VDO since it is pretty simple and static. By removing getting VDO we can not compare old and new value, because of this there is also need to send it in case of non usb device capable port, just in case we want to disable this and previously was enabled.",
      "parentUuid": "8890ca30_56943911",
      "revId": "2abc9c53af8c5c76933e334759b5fabdccc95f5b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
