      "writtenOn": "2026-05-28T20:07:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: The states should be called something like GET_IDH and SET_IDH. You might add another state later that sets a different VDO.",
      "revId": "2abc9c53af8c5c76933e334759b5fabdccc95f5b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
