      "writtenOn": "2026-05-28T20:07:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see where you\u0027re using the IDH that you retrieved in the last state. I think this function would be more composable if it took a `struct id_header_vdo_rev30` or `union id_header_vdo_rev30` (see comment below) as a parameter and just set whatever value was passed in. This state would then take the previously gotten IDH and make the specific field change you want to make before passing it into `rts54_set_vdo_idh`. That would separate concerns and make the intent clear.",
      "revId": "2abc9c53af8c5c76933e334759b5fabdccc95f5b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
